*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
SELECTION-SCREEN : FUNCTION KEY 1.
SELECTION-SCREEN : FUNCTION KEY 2.
SELECTION-SCREEN : FUNCTION KEY 3.
SELECTION-SCREEN : FUNCTION KEY 4.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK1 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S01.
  "향후 권한 연동하여 User별 Defalut 값 관리시 Display 필드로 변경(WERKS)
  SELECT-OPTIONS : S_WERKS FOR MSEG-WERKS      OBLIGATORY,
                   S_BUDAT FOR MSEG-BUDAT_MKPF OBLIGATORY NO-EXTENSION.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK1.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK2 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S02.
  SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF LINE.
    PARAMETERS : P_WEEK RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR2
                             USER-COMMAND GR2 DEFAULT 'X'.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R01 FOR FIELD P_WEEK.

    SELECTION-SCREEN POSITION 32.
    PARAMETERS : P_DAY  RADIOBUTTON GROUP GR2.
    SELECTION-SCREEN COMMENT (15) TEXT-R02 FOR FIELD P_DAY.
  SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF LINE.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK2.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK BK3 WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-S03.
  PARAMETERS : P_SAVE AS CHECKBOX.
SELECTION-SCREEN END   OF BLOCK BK3.
